{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Timing 是一款為首爾旅客而設的交通導航程式，以全英文介面顯示地鐵與市區巴士的到站資訊，即使攜帶大型行李亦能輕鬆往來。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合初次到訪首爾、不諳韓文的旅客。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-60.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>路線圖與到站資訊清晰易查</h2>\n<p>Timing 以英文呈現首爾地鐵路線圖，點按車站即可查看分方向到站時間及相距站數；巴士站顯示接下來兩班車與擁擠程度。用家可輸入英文、韓文站名或五位數字站號搜尋，並收藏常用站點。旅客可在有公開資料的車站查閱升降機、最近車門、置物櫃及洗手間指引，程式毋須帳戶與定位。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-56-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-57-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-58-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-59-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-60-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-61-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Timing: Seoul Subway &amp; Bus</li><li>應用類別：Navigation</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/timing-seoul-subway-bus/id6818429200?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T05:25:34.217562+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T04:58:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:19:00.126342+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T05:18:52.186190+00:00","content_hash":"67c0a4b945b215fa09d50961404d782ede4d2fdf5dd7850b1d38c7910a33f73f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}